    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 11, 2026</p>
    <p>Echoes Analytics is a personal creator analytics
  dashboard that reads video performance data from TikTok to
   help the creator track their own content metrics.</p>

    <h2>Data Collected</h2>
    <p>This application accesses the following data from
  your TikTok account via the TikTok API:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Video view counts, like counts, comment counts,
  and share counts</li>
      <li>Basic account information (username, follower
  count)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How Data Is Used</h2>
    <p>All data is used solely for personal analytics
  purposes by the account owner. No data is stored on
  external servers, sold, or shared with any third
  party.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>Data is retrieved on demand and not persistently
  stored beyond the local session.</p>

    <h2>Third Parties</h2>
    <p>This application does not share any data with third
  parties.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about this privacy policy, contact: <a
  href="mailto:gabe@elevateddailystudios.com">gabe@elevatedd
  ailystudios.com</a></p>
